Package: piagent
Title: Chat with the 'Pi' Coding Agent from R
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Dongdong", "Kong", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "kongdd.sysu@gmail.com")
Description: An 'ellmer'-style interface to the 'pi' coding agent command line
    tool. Each conversation is backed by a 'pi' session, so the assistant can
    read files, run shell commands, and edit code inside a working directory.
    Provides blocking, streaming, and asynchronous access to the agent, and
    token and cost accounting parsed from the 'pi' JSON event stream.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    data.table,
    jsonlite,
    later,
    processx,
    promises,
    R6
Suggests:
    ellmer,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
